{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は『Rakuten GirlsAward 2023 S/S』\nに出演させていただきました🌼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演できて嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に観に来てくださった方も、\n配信を観てくださった方も、\nありがとうございました🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「次のアーティストは櫻坂46です」\nってなったときの歓声が嬉しくて、\nメンバーと一緒に喜んでました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは、\n・桜月\n・摩擦係数\n・BAN\nでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装は水色のスーツでした💎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのランウェイも観れました〜\n可愛くてかっこよかったなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZZ34WBER9TCFJMXKH2CH9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひかるちゃんがヘアアレンジしてるとつい、\nかわいい！って話しかけちゃいます🫶🏻\nどんな髪型でも似合っててかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZZ4574HWEM4AHHEVP0TTY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランウェイ歩いて、\n楽屋で学校の課題やって、\nまたライブ出ててカッコいい…！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も、てんちゃんの卒業式に\n行きたいって言いました🫶🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZZ565YZVB0QYFK41HAY44","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほのちゃんと楽屋で隣の席でした🫶🏻\nランウェイ本当にかわいかった〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZZ68C3PBB2BKB5AEQ39B5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"✌🏻同期✌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":